{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-08_end",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-08",
  "title": "應對飽和打擊",
  "storyCode": "14-9",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2e770df5a2a6f13a2822b14dd5bfba8203861e97f380e00599779c8b8c6815ec",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行動開始後六十八小時"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "煙塵與濃霧互相撕扯。\n“加斯特里爾”號的甲板上爬滿了食腐者的枯枝與種子。那些曾轟碎無數堡壘的艦炮，七成已無法發出任何聲響。\n牙齒拔得差不多了，爪子也差不多磨平了，下一步，原本該是拆解和吞噬獵物的血肉。\n然而，食腐者的王座也已被數十道帶著鎖鏈的破城矛貫穿。\n只差一步，戰爭之神就會被拉下他的王座。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你向我證明了，戰爭的前進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "兩百年前，還沒有維多利亞人能堅持到這一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……呵，薩卡茲，你也並不是什麼老朽的虛影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們確實是這片大地的威脅。或許在撕碎高盧之後，我該早一些驅使我的軍艦踏上卡茲戴爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你不會有這樣的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們，都不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“靈幛”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "赦罪師的訊號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“靈幛”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是……“提卡茲之血”的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "食腐者之王將整片戰場納入眼簾。\n敵人在嘗試停止風暴。這或許會改變戰局，但並非關鍵。沒有天災時，他的戰士也一樣兇猛，一樣永不退縮。\n威靈頓是個值得一戰的對手，可衰老很快就會將他帶走。他並不屬於未來的戰爭。\n真正的威脅，來自別處，來自……後方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "特雷西斯和赦罪師在提醒我，此處並非唯一的戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“靈幛”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您親自去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "軍事委員會許諾的，當下與未來的戰爭……我已得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "食腐者也必須踐行對攝政王的承諾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但離開之前，這片戰場還需播種些腐朽的種子，待我歸來割取。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "濃霧漫起。\n戰場之上，只餘王座。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那個食腐者……逃走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，真正的戰爭，絕無撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等，將軍，看那個王座！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "霧氣正從王座上不斷彌漫下來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳……咳……這不是普通的霧氣，它在腐蝕我的身體！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "將軍，您的身體——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "士兵，報告“加斯特里爾”號的情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艙室損傷超過百分之六十。根據您事先的命令，推進能力基本保存完好！至於武器——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "卸掉那些基本不能用的，原地丟棄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "把下層的源石火炮推出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那些已經……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "舊了。但依然能殺傷敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "通知“加斯特里爾”號，按照預定計劃撤到G-0高地，繼續鞏固那裡的工事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們也迅速跟上，命令所有戰線後撤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "接下來，這些薩卡茲就送給開斯特和高多汀處理吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "謝伊那邊的訊息呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "隊長和愛布拉娜殿下基本控制住了這片區域的食腐者祭壇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……嗯，看到了。她的火……很鮮豔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "醫療兵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不需要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤鐵近衛隊成員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "將軍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "威靈頓公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一場未分勝負的戰鬥……不會是我經歷的最後一戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“聯合艦隊指揮部緊急通訊——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……還有三分鐘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "從我們所在的位置，應該也能聽到炮響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的，閣下。威靈頓縱隊和我們相隔不遠，確保了能夠彼此支援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這場戰鬥將決定維多利亞的命運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要一切順利，這確實——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "能以最快的速度結束這場無謂的僵持。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那雙眼睛裡，的確滿是對戰爭的渴望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那他是否別有用心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "二十年了，我的桌子裡塞滿了和他有關的情報和相應的應對提案。這幾天，這些報告更是以每天十幾次的頻率更新著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "解決完薩卡茲問題，才是真正鬥爭的開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "至於此時此刻……需要一場決定性勝利的人，並不是只有威靈頓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "時間到了。進攻該開始了，他向來守時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯，聽吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“加斯特里爾”號的全炮輪射……與我們開斯特的艦船，有多麼不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但這一戰之後，開斯特的名字，將與威靈頓一樣，在維多利亞戰爭史上閃耀——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“警告異常，警告異常，00和01！重複！00和01！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "該死，通訊斷了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "閣下，所有來自威靈頓公爵的訊號都……消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "突然出現一支薩卡茲的隊伍混在天災裡與我們的前線部隊交戰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "威靈頓在幹什麼？！這個時候突然獨自行動，是為了……搶功？他是年紀大到腦子糊塗了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我有一種……猜想。他會不會騙了開斯特……騙了所有人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這……不合邏輯。那可是鐵公爵，他難道會放棄更好控制的公爵同僚，轉而和薩卡茲合謀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這是公爵之間的博弈邏輯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "身為戰士的溫德米爾公爵，會怎樣對待她的敵人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……殺盡他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "把敵人最後一滴血，抹在收繳的戰利品上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在成為維多利亞第一大公爵之前，威靈頓帶兵的時間，比你的母親還要長幾十年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "作為大貴族中的大貴族，開斯特習慣了所有人遵循同一套遊戲規則。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在牌桌上待久了，她可能忘了，有些不講道理的人，比如我們這種幫派混混，是會掀桌子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "假如，那位鐵公爵真的把整個維多利亞視作敵人，而不是競爭對手——他根本不會給開斯特交易的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "天災！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "下一波天災來得比隨軍天災信使們預測的更快——所有通訊都斷了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "多久能修好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "十五分鐘。不，十分鐘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你是從威靈頓所在的方向趕回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "重傷。誰幹的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不是鐵公爵的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他……輸給了那個薩卡茲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“加斯特里爾”號開炮之後，一支食腐者的先遣大隊在迷霧中現身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們的速度很快，依靠已經出現過的祭壇，擊毀了一艘小型軍艦——亞伯寇恩的步兵和他們纏鬥了一會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們本以為“加斯特里爾”號會支援這艘軍艦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他撤退了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是的。“加斯特里爾”號掉頭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "其他威靈頓的戰艦全部掩護著旗艦後撤。他們的隨軍術師……也改換了施術目標，頂著我們其他軍艦的炮火，掩護自己的船後退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……亞伯寇恩和阿什沃思的船呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "完全暴露在食腐者的攻擊下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們原本以為自己是負責支援的人，沒想到一下子成了先鋒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "威靈頓的船完全堵住了撤退的路線，而且他還在試圖把亞伯寇恩他們推到前面去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "堅持不了多久，剩餘的聯軍就會潰敗……完全淪為食腐者的養料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "閣下，派去戰線中心的聯合縱隊已經崩潰，薩卡茲會立刻回援後方，也就是我們所處的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "切割包圍薩卡茲的計劃失敗了，我們可能會被反過來包圍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可能？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，已經發生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "開斯特公爵",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "包裹住我們的天災……不僅僅是天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……食腐者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "訊號回來了，我們撞上了一支食腐者大隊……不，一整個食腐者軍團！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "右翼也有，那是第二個軍團？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們已經開始交戰，天災放大了食腐者的巫術——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高級軍官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "源石反應還在急遽增強，保護閣下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "戰場上仍能收到微弱訊號的部隊，都在同一時間收到了一則模糊不清的訊息——\n“榮光”號，確認被摧毀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "維娜想起自己第一次看到“高速軍艦”的時刻。\n那是在父親的書桌上。那個模型小小的，只有成年人的小臂那麼長。只要輕輕一戳，水晶做的旗杆就會歪倒。\n父親制止了她亂動的手，告訴她，高速軍艦是征服大地的鋼鐵巨獸，和倫蒂尼姆這座永不陷落的城市一樣，是維多利亞工業技術的驕傲。\n“亞歷山德莉娜，等你再長大一些，我就帶你登上最新的軍艦。你會看到的。”\n很多年後，維娜確實看見了，不過是在戰場上。\n無論是溫德米爾、開斯特還是威靈頓的軍艦，都是那麼雄偉，把站在下方的人襯得很渺小。\n然而這一刻，眼前被源石巨浪捧在掌心的破碎軍艦，彷彿又變回了小時候那個玩具的模樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "源石……浪潮，劈碎了“榮光”號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我的耳膜……還在陣痛——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那艘軍艦被摧毀的動靜……恐怕附近的所有人都聽到了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那個開什麼的公爵……就這麼死了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘖……達格達，你不會這就嚇傻了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "手在抖的人是你，因陀羅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "達格達，你一直在沉默。你在想什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "達格達",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這個節骨眼上，開斯特公爵就這麼死了，薩卡茲的意圖太明顯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼意圖？警告？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，是訊號。薩卡茲將要開始總進攻的訊號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "通知我們的戰友們，準備迎接接下來的衝擊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "開斯特公爵沒有死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "號角小姐！我們隊伍裡的士氣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "剛才有不小的騷動。沒人見過這種……場面，包括我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過隊長已經組織了一幫一直跟著你們的老人去安撫那些新兵蛋子了。嗯，效果看上去不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "風笛，不要下意識按我們的標準要求他們。典範軍的情況，很特殊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔，收到，隊長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摩根",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "號角小姐，你剛說……開斯特公爵沒有死？你看上去很篤定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們看，“榮光”號的炮口自始至終沒有解除瞄準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "因陀羅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "維多利亞的大公爵或許有百般不是……但不是隨便什麼人都能在那個位子上安穩坐上幾十年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "既然“榮光”號還沒有放棄抵抗，開斯特公爵就沒有死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "至於現在裡面的真實情況是什麼……或許那位“灰禮帽”更加清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“榮光”號出事的瞬間，他就離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "恐怕他也正在附近某個地方試圖聯繫“榮光”號，想搞清楚發生了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但按照他的說法，我們要找的劍座也在那裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "推進之王，那接下來要如何行動？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "前哨剛剛傳回消息！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "“榮光”號被突然奔襲過來的王庭軍完全包圍，威靈頓公爵的部隊也已後撤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "周邊區域的戰況正急劇惡化——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戴菲恩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "維娜，恐怕……我們得馬上暫停行軍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
